ASET-NETWORK-PROFILES 1 ASET-NETWORK-ALPHA4-PROFILES alpha4
PARENT-SUBJECT network/alpha4/NETWORK.aset
SEMANTIC-PRECEDENCE NONE
ALPHA3-COMPATIBILITY NONE

PROFILE DYNAMIC network/alpha4/profiles/dynamic/DYNAMIC.aset OPTIONAL
PROFILE FEDERATION network/alpha4/profiles/federation/FEDERATION.aset OPTIONAL
PROFILE LIVENESS network/alpha4/profiles/liveness/LIVENESS.aset OPTIONAL
COMPOSITION FEDERATION-LIVENESS network/alpha4/profiles/composition/federation-liveness/FEDERATION_LIVENESS.aset ASSURANCE-ONLY

INVARIANT PROFILE-ACTIVATION TARGET-LOCAL-SEED-ALLOW-ON-EXACT-BINDING
INVARIANT CORE-STATE-OWNERSHIP NETWORK-ONLY
INVARIANT PROFILE-AUTHORITY-INHERITANCE NEVER
INVARIANT PROFILE-COMPOSITION-PARENT-RELATION NEVER
INVARIANT PROFILE-OPERATIONAL-RELATIONAL-PAIRING REQUIRED
INVARIANT OPERATIONAL-EXPRESSION-SUBJECT SEMANTIC-OBJECT
INVARIANT OPERATIONAL-EXPRESSION-REQUIRES-STATE NEVER
INVARIANT OPERATIONAL-EXPRESSION-REQUIRES-TRANSITION NEVER

CHECK PROFILE-SURFACE tools/alpha4_network_profiles_gate.py
CHECK PROFILE-PAIRING tools/alpha4_network_profile_paired_expression.py
CHECK PROFILE-TLAPS tools/run_alpha4_network_profile_tlaps.py
CHECK PROFILE-TLC tools/run_alpha4_network_profile_tlc.py
